        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Size
      value: 0.53456885
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4586130411077341659, guid: 86034297a83190f49ab0adafb47440cb,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Value
      value: 1.0000026
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5336956100140916112, guid: 86034297a83190f49ab0adafb47440cb,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "As mentioned in the Whitelist section, Modern UIs includes built-in
        support for displaying lists of player names. Combined with Creator Economy
        integration, this can be used to showcase supporters, VIP members, staff
        teams, event participants, and more directly within your world.\n\nWhen paired
        with the built-in Auto Scroll system, these displays provide an easy way
        to create dynamic supporter boards and recognition walls.\n\nAll display
        types are available as both standalone components and Main UI Elements.\n\n<b>Advanced
        Name Display</b>\n\n\u2022 Available with or without sections\n\u2022 Supports
        both Whitelists and Creator Economy products\n\u2022 Display one or multiple
        lists simultaneously\n\u2022 Multiple formatting options, including:\n   
        \u2022 New Lines\n    \u2022 Comma Separated\n    \u2022 Custom Separators\n\u2022
        Supports custom text when a list is empty\n\u2022 Can display the number
        of players contained within a list\n\n<b>Auto Scroll</b>\n\nThe Auto Scroll
        component automatically moves Scroll Rect content, making it ideal for supporter
        boards, announcements, credits, changelogs, and other continuously displayed
        information.\n\n<b>Features</b>\n\n\u2022 Supports both vertical and horizontal
        scrolling\n\u2022 Works with any Scroll Rect\n\u2022 Can be grabbed and manually
        scrolled by users at any time\n\u2022 Customizable scroll speed\n\u2022 Adjustable
        start transition for smooth scrolling behavior"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5757065297534502311, guid: 86034297a83190f49ab0adafb47440cb,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Info
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
