      propertyPath: m_Value
      value: 1.0000012
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5336956100140916112, guid: 86034297a83190f49ab0adafb47440cb,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Notifications can also be sent across the network using the Network
        Notification Relay.\n\nThe relay provides functionality similar to the Notification
        Manager while being designed specifically for sending notifications between
        players.\n\n<b>Differences from the Notification Manager</b>\n\n<b>Sound
        IDs</b>\n\u2022 Instead of providing an Audio Clip directly, notifications
        reference a predefined Sound ID\n\u2022 Sounds are configured beforehand
        on the relay\n\n<b>Image IDs</b>\n\u2022 Instead of providing a Sprite directly,
        notifications reference a predefined Image ID\n\u2022 Images are configured
        beforehand on the relay\n\n<b>Security & Permissions</b>\n\n\u2022 The relay
        can optionally use a whitelist to control who is allowed to send notifications\n\u2022
        Helps prevent abuse and unwanted notifications from unauthorized users\n\n<b>Custom
        Network Notification Sender</b>\n\nOnce a relay has been configured, a Custom
        Network Notification Sender can be connected to it.\n\nThis provides a user
        interface for creating and sending custom notifications to other players.\n\n<b>Configurable
        Fields</b>\n\n\u2022 Header / Title\n\u2022 Message Content\n\u2022 Sound
        ID\n\u2022 Image ID\n\u2022 Display Duration\n\n<b>Integration with Notification
        History</b>\n\nNetwork notifications also integrate with the Notification
        History system.\n\nAdditional information, such as who sent the notification,
        can also be displayed within the history view."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5757065297534502311, guid: 86034297a83190f49ab0adafb47440cb,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Info
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
