      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5336956100140916112, guid: 86034297a83190f49ab0adafb47440cb,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Players contained within whitelists can be displayed in a variety of
        ways. These displays can be useful for debugging, staff lists, supporter
        recognition, event management, or any other situation where player names
        need to be visible.\n\nAll display types are available as both standalone
        components and Main UI Elements.\n\n<b>Display Types</b>\n\n<b>Whitelist
        Name Display</b>\n\u2022 Displays all names contained within a whitelist\n\u2022
        Simple and lightweight solution\n\u2022 Legacy component\n\n<b>Fancy Name
        Display</b>\n\u2022 Displays each name on its own individual object\n\u2022
        Provides a more visually appealing presentation\n\u2022 Legacy component\n\n<b>Advanced
        Name Display</b>\n\u2022 The recommended solution for displaying player names\n\u2022
        Available with or without sections\n\u2022 Supports both whitelists and Creator
        Economy products\n\u2022 Multiple formatting options, including:\n    \u2022
        New Lines\n    \u2022 Comma Separated\n    \u2022 Custom Separators\n\u2022
        Supports custom text when a list is empty\n\u2022 Can display the number
        of players contained within a list"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5757065297534502311, guid: 86034297a83190f49ab0adafb47440cb,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Info
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
