      value: "Modern UIs whitelist and permission system integrates with many other
        systems throughout the package, making it easy to control access, manage
        roles, and create advanced permission-based experiences.\n\n<b>Examples</b>\n\n\u2022
        Control who can interact with sliders, toggles, selectors, and other UI elements\n\u2022
        Restrict access to areas, floors, rooms, or other world features\n\u2022
        Combine Creator Economy products, staff permissions, and Patreon benefits
        through integrations such as VRC Linking and Disbridge\n\u2022 Control who
        can send notifications across the network\n\n<b>Integration with Other Systems</b>\n\nThe
        whitelist system also makes use of other Modern UIs features. For example,
        permission changes can automatically generate popup notifications, allowing
        users to receive immediate feedback when access is granted, revoked, or modified.\n\nFor
        more information, check out the <b>Notifications</b> section."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5757065297534502311, guid: 86034297a83190f49ab0adafb47440cb,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: How do Whitelists Integrate?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6624245001341242104, guid: 86034297a83190f49ab0adafb47440cb,
        type: 3}
