      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5336956100140916112, guid: 86034297a83190f49ab0adafb47440cb,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Whitelist Combiners allow multiple whitelists to be merged into a single
        source. This is useful when a permission can be granted through multiple
        systems, such as VRC Linking and the Creator Economy.\n\n<b>Combiner Types</b>\n\n<b>1.
        Whitelist Combiner</b>\n\u2022 Combines multiple whitelists into a single
        whitelist\n\u2022 Does not apply any additional logic\n\u2022 Implements
        only the Whitelist Getter Base, meaning it can only be read from\n\u2022
        Changes must always be made on the source whitelists\n\n<b>2. Whitelist Logic
        Combiner</b>\n\u2022 Combines multiple whitelists while applying configurable
        logic\n\u2022 Implements only the Whitelist Getter Base and can only be read
        from\n\u2022 Supports the following logic modes:\n\n    <b>Require All</b>\n   
        \u2022 A player must be present on every source whitelist to be considered
        whitelisted\n\n    <b>Require Exactly One</b>\n    \u2022 A player is considered
        whitelisted only if they appear on exactly one source whitelist\n\n    <b>Subtract</b>\n   
        \u2022 Only works with two whitelists\n    \u2022 Removes all players found
        on the second whitelist from the first whitelist"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5757065297534502311, guid: 86034297a83190f49ab0adafb47440cb,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Info
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
