      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5336956100140916112, guid: 86034297a83190f49ab0adafb47440cb,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Whitelists can originate from a variety of sources, not just lists
        that are modified in-game. All whitelist sources implement the Whitelist
        Getter Base, allowing them to be used anywhere a standard whitelist is supported.\n\n<b>Built-In
        Sources</b>\n\n<b>String Loading</b>\n\u2022 Loads whitelist data from an
        external text source\n\u2022 Supports services such as GitHub, Pastebin,
        and similar platforms\n\u2022 Useful for managing permissions without republishing
        your world\n\n<b>Creator Economy</b>\n\u2022 Uses VRChat Creator Economy
        products as a whitelist source\n\u2022 Players who own one of the specified
        product are considered whitelisted\n\u2022 Only players currently present
        in the instance can be detected\n\n<b>Instance Options</b>\n\u2022 Automatically
        whitelists special instance roles\n\u2022 Supports:\n    \u2022 First Player
        Joined\n    \u2022 Instance Owner\n    \u2022 Network Master\n\u2022 Useful
        for setting up a world host-style system\n\n<b>External Sources & Integrations</b>\n\n<b>VRC
        Linking</b>\n\u2022 Retrieves whitelist data from VRC Linking using Role
        IDs\n\n<b>Disbridge</b>\n\u2022 Retrieves whitelist data directly from Disbridge\n\n<b>Access
        TXL</b>\n\u2022 Retrieves whitelist data from Access TXL\n\u2022 Can also
        expose a Modern UIs whitelist directly to Access TXL to be used in their
        system"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5757065297534502311, guid: 86034297a83190f49ab0adafb47440cb,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Info
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
