      objectReference: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a345979c1a25cdf48a4b3d4462134e04,
        type: 2}
    - target: {fileID: 5336956100140916112, guid: 86034297a83190f49ab0adafb47440cb,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Modern UIs is a collection of prefabs, scripts, and UI elements designed
        to help creators build clean, modern-looking interfaces and permission systems
        for VRChat worlds.\n\nThis world showcases a selection of features and systems
        included with Modern UIs. Its primary focus is ease of implementation and
        flexibility while maintaining a polished, modern appearance. At the same
        time, it is designed to be intuitive for users, providing a smooth, responsive,
        and satisfying.\n\n<b>Features:</b>\n\u2022 Modular prefabs for fast, flexible
        UI building\n\u2022 Built-in permission systems with support for third-party
        integrations, including:\n    \u2022 VRC Linking\n    \u2022 Disbridge\n   
        \u2022 AccessTXL\n\u2022 Support for VRChat's Creator Economy\n\u2022 Simple
        color themes using the built in theming system\n\u2022 Smooth, animation-driven
        transitions and feedback\n\u2022 Designed for clarity, usability, and a modern
        aesthetic\n\u2022 Easy to integrate and customize for different world setups\n\n<b>Interested?</b>\nTo
        acquire Modern UIs, join my Discord server under <b>https://discord.drblackrat.xyz</b>
        and check out the <b>#modern-uis-info</b> channel for more information."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
